1
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,160
Why are you two here?

2
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,620
I'm looking for my mother,

3
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:00,600
Wu Mingyue.

4
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,640
Your mother?

5
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,000
Yes.

6
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,340
She went missing 16 years ago.

7
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:08,960
But I think she's still alive,

8
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,320
somewhere in Xinchun.

9
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,920
I just haven't found her yet.

10
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,960
Two months ago,

11
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,400
near this cabin,

12
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:17,440
I saw someone who looked a lot like her.

13
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:19,840
We were looking for her the last time we met.

14
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,080
Now I'm even more certain

15
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,820
that she must be alive.

16
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,650
The words on the wall inside

17
00:01:29,039 --> 00:01:30,080
say 'Fei',

18
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,480
which is my name.

19
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,280
My mother told me

20
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,800
that 'Fei' means

21
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,680
snowflake,

22
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,600
symbolizing purity

23
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:42,920
and beauty.

24
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:45,080
She is telling me

25
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,320
that she's still alive,

26
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,920
and she hasn't forgotten me.

27
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:50,080
Officer Cao.

28
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,560
I suspect

29
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,479
the person who imprisoned Xuefei's mother

30
00:01:53,479 --> 00:01:55,600
and killed Teng Xiaohu is the same person,

31
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,160
and it's related to the 16...

32
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,000
Ms. Li,

33
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,039
please get in the car first.

34
00:01:59,039 --> 00:02:01,700
We'll need you to make a formal statement later.

35
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,480
You go back first.

36
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:14,880
Wang Hong.

37
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,530
After I finish my work at the station tonight,

38
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,560
let's talk.

39
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,440
There are some things

40
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,840
I want to ask you face to face.

41
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:26,960
Anytime.

42
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,410
The usual place.

43
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,320
You know it.

44
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,650
See you tonight.

45
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,490
Have some water.

46
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:56,040
No, thanks.

47
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,920
I have to go find

48
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,360
Cao Jin tonight.

49
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:05,640
Go ahead.

50
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,720
I'll go home too.

51
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:11,040
Contact me if anything happens.

52
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,720
Got it.

53
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:23,770
You're back.

54
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,970
What were you doing dressed like this?

55
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,240
I hired some workers

56
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,100
to tear down our small warehouse.

57
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,880
Why are you messing with that again?

58
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,520
I'm planning to build a new workshop.

59
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:34,400
When we get more orders,

60
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,930
