61
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,440
Let's eat at home.

62
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,240
I'll go cook.

63
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,200
I'm not eating, Dad.

64
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,329
You go ahead and eat.

65
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,380
So many dishes.

66
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:32,960
Come on, eat.

67
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:34,940
Let's have a drink.

68
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,560
Beer or liquor?

69
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,360
Liquor.

70
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,540
It's stronger.

71
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,360
Okay.

72
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,040
Let me.

73
00:04:52,159 --> 00:04:52,840
I'll do it.

74
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,440
It's been years since you drank with me.

75
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,240
This is great.

76
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,180
Cheers.

77
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,760
The factory doesn't have that many orders right now.

78
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:26,560
You spent so much money tearing down the warehouse

79
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,920
and building a new factory.

80
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,780
