81
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:33,159
Business isn't good right now, is it?

82
00:05:33,159 --> 00:05:34,159
I heard people say

83
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,320
that a new house and a new stove

84
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,760
bring a fresh start for the new year.

85
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,820
Just for good luck.

86
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,000
Something happened at the east tree farm.

87
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,880
Did you know?

88
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,200
I didn't know.

89
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,440
What happened?

90
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,530
Teng Xiaohu is dead.

91
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,200
How did he die?

92
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,560
He was strangled.

93
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,380
Teng Laohu has been competitive his whole life.

94
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,320
He treasured his son so much,

95
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:03,760
afraid he'd melt in his mouth

96
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,490
or fall if he put him on his head.

97
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,420
If he finds out his son is dead,

98
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,960
how will Teng Laohu survive?

99
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,160
How do you know

100
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,400
he's dead?

101
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:21,120
Because Wang Hong and I found the body

102
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:23,560
in the cabin at the tree farm.

103
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,440
What were you two doing there

104
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,840
in the middle of nowhere?

105
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,610
I was looking for my mom.

106
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,720
Are you stupid?

107
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:35,570
Why would your mom be in the middle of nowhere?

108
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:36,840
Guess what?

109
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,560
I actually found her.

110
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,800
The walls of that cabin were carved

111
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:43,060
with the character 'Fei' from Li Xuefei.

112
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,280
For 16 years,

113
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,970
my mom never left Xinchun, did she?

114
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,320
Daughter,

115
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,580
how many times have I told you?

116
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,440
Back then,

117
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,320
