118
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,720
She ran off with someone else.

119
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,920
Who did she run off with?

120
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,850
Where did she go?

121
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,040
Did you call the police?

122
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,700
How many times have I told you?

123
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:09,240
Your mom didn't care about us,

124
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,160
this family,

125
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,120
or you as her daughter.

126
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,250
Did you look for her?

127
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:14,450
Did you ask relatives and friends?

128
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,360
Besides slandering her,

129
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,490
what else did you do?

130
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,280
Okay.

131
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:23,840
Li Xuefei.

132
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,010
You've grown up,

133
00:07:26,440 --> 00:07:28,000
and you think you can fly on your own.

134
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,960
Hanging out with big bosses out there,

135
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,880
you have someone backing you up now, right?

136
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:35,480
How dare you come back and question your dad so disrespectfully!

137
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,440
Go find her.

138
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:39,800
Go find your mom.

139
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:43,090
I have nothing to say to you.

140
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,170
Let's eat first.

141
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:49,560
I'm full.

142
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,360
How have you been

143
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,640
