158
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,480
I can never forget it.

159
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,480
Besides,

160
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:56,600
didn't we agree

161
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,700
