162
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,600
Do you hate me?

163
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,770
If it weren't for my family,

164
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,780
Uncle Cao wouldn't have died.

165
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,920
I'm a police officer.

166
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:19,050
Police catching criminals

167
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,840
is perfectly justified.

168
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,320
It has nothing to do with you.

169
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,460
But there is one thing.

170
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:34,290
I really need an explanation from you.

171
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,680
Go ahead.

172
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:38,320
I've waited for you for too long.

173
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:41,000
You should have come to me as soon as you got back.

174
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,760
You know?

175
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:45,080
It's not too late now.

176
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,770
About Teng Xiaohu's death,

177
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:55,960
what do you think?

178
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,900
Clues are limited.

179
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,560
In the woods,

180
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:00,940
