184
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,680
Xuefei and I found out

185
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,300
that her mother

186
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,900
and my mother used to be good friends.

187
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:19,280
The night my family had the accident,

188
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,940
her mother also went missing.

189
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,480
So we think

190
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,800
if we can find her mother,

191
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,680
we might be able to find out

192
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,080
what happened back then.

193
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,680
So,

194
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,640
do you have any suspects?

195
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,600
Chen Lu gave me this.

196
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:42,640
This is the receipt from when they transported

197
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:44,300
the old Korean pine back then.

198
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,720
I compared the handwriting.

199
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,800
It doesn't look like Li Zhijun's,

200
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:51,680
Lin Shengli's,

201
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,400
or Teng Laohu's.

202
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,800
Then besides those three,

203
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,560
who else could it be?

204
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,320
Someone called me before.

205
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:06,250
He said he knew about my family's affairs.

206
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:09,400
He asked me to meet him at the abandoned railway in the west of the city.

207
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:10,120
I went,

208
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:11,900
but I didn't catch him.

209
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,920
When did this happen?

210
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,200
Why didn't you tell me?

211
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,050
Before the New Year.

212
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,690
He knows a lot of things.

213
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:19,960
And

214
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,160
he came to kill me.

215
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,600
And then?

216
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,200
I feel like

217
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:31,130
this person is probably still in Xinchun.

218
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,730
He might even be right under our noses.

219
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,810
There's one more thing.

220
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,760
Xuefei and I

221
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,360
will go check for clues again tomorrow.

222
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,280
Lin Shengli's

223
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,840
health might be failing.

224
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,460
He might know some things.

225
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,800
I need you to keep an eye on him for me.

226
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:53,980
I'll arrange for someone.

227
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,620
The person who called you,

228
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,400
do you know who it was?

229
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,690
I checked the phone number,

230
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,500
but I couldn't find anything.

231
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,880
Let me remind you.

232
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,080
Investigate all you want,

233
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,640
but don't cross the legal line,

234
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:14,160
even if you get the evidence.

235
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,820
It has no legal effect either.

236
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,180
It's getting late.

237
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:19,840
Let's go back.

238
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:29,440
Get some rest.

239
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,080
Brother.

240
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,600
Happy belated New Year.

241
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,200
Welcome home.

242
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:46,380
Happy New Year.

243
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,280
Get some rest.

244
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:34,600
What's wrong?

245
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:35,920
Nothing.

246
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:37,380
Show it to me, Lin Shengli.

247
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,080
Show it to me.

248
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:46,440
Lin Shengli.

249
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:48,680
If you're going to leave,

250
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:49,560
then just leave.

251
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:50,880
Stop torturing me.

252
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,120
After you're gone, I'll take your money

253
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,000
and find a gigolo.

254
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:53,920
I'll go shopping every day,

255
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:54,600
