256
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,680
and piss you off.

257
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,640
Now I can rest easy.

258
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,680
The debts I owed

259
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,520
have all been paid off.

260
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,720
What debts?

261
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,280
Lie down quickly.

262
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:10,840
Slow down, slow down.

263
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,440
Slow down, slow down.

264
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:15,640
Slow down. Take it easy.

265
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,120
Don't cry.

266
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:22,840
Xue Ling.

267
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:28,170
I have three things to tell you.

268
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,000
First,

269
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,440
after I'm gone,

270
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:38,660
