271
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,540
You've stayed with me all these years

272
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:45,010
and haven't fulfilled your duties as a daughter.

273
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,120
It's my fault.

274
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:50,280
Help me apologize

275
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:53,400
