276
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,200
Second,

277
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:01,920
there's a letter in the cabinet on the right.

278
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,040
At the right time,

279
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:10,240
give it to the right person for me.

280
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,400
Third,

281
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:23,840
Xue Ling.

282
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:27,840
In this life,

283
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,840
the happiest thing

284
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:36,120
was meeting you.

285
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:39,810
The most regrettable thing

286
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,200
was also meeting you.

287
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:47,720
Shengli, don't go.

288
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:51,160
Don't leave me.

289
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,680
I won't leave you.

290
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:59,120
Don't leave me.

291
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:02,800
Xue Ling.

292
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:33,080
